      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "美国经济学家父类职业通常至少需要硕士学位；部分政府入门岗位可接受具备足够相关课程的学士，环境经济学家岗位另核。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "environmental-economists.path.career-path-block.1",
          "source_refs": [
            "bls-economists-current"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "作品使用EE-3虚构方案。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "environmental-economists.path.career-path-block.2",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-env-econ"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "基准排放100单位。A成本60,000元、减排20单位；B成本120,000元、减排30单位；预算上限100,000元。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "environmental-economists.path.career-path-block.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-env-econ"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "任务：计算每单位减排成本，判断预算内可行方案，并说明不能回答的问题。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "environmental-economists.path.career-path-block.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-env-econ"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "参考答案：A为3,000元/单位，B为4,000元/单位；预算内只有A可行。因未给环境与社会收益，不能判断净社会收益或宣称A总体最优。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "environmental-economists.path.career-path-block.5",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-env-econ"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "EE-3表格逐行写入A、B的成本和减排量、60,000÷20与120,000÷30的算式、预算判断，并注明社会收益未提供。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "environmental-economists.path.career-path-block.6",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-env-econ"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "七日体验可改变一个虚构输入并复算敏感性。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "environmental-economists.path.career-path-block.7",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-env-econ"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "成长看更可靠的数据、模型、解释和沟通证据，不承诺固定年限。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "environmental-economists.path.career-path-block.8",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial-env-econ"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        }
      ]
